 "code": "const int TRIG = 7;\nconst int ECHO = 6;\nconst int BUZZ = 2;\nconst int LED = 13;\n\nlong readCm() {\n  digitalWrite(TRIG, LOW);\n  delayMicroseconds(2);\n  digitalWrite(TRIG, HIGH);\n  delayMicroseconds(10);\n  digitalWrite(TRIG, LOW);\n  return pulseIn(ECHO, HIGH) / 58;\n}\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(TRIG, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(ECHO, INPUT);\n  pinMode(LED, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  long cm = readCm();\n  Serial.println(cm);\n  // ваша логика парктроника\n  delay(100);\n}\n",
